00082434  6100 0064                282      BSR     get_filename        * get the filename from the line or the request
00082438  6700 0274                283      BEQ     LAB_FCER            * if null do function call error then warm start
0008243C  303C 0033                284      MOVE    #51,d0              * open existing file
00082440  4E4F                     285      TRAP    #15                 * do I/O function
00082442  4A40                     286      TST.w   d0                  * test load result
00082444  6610                     287      BNE.s   LOAD_exit           * if error clear up and exit
00082446  2741 05EC                288      MOVE.l  d1,file_id(a3)      * save the file ID
0008244A  43FA 0012                289      LEA     LOAD_in(pc),a1      * get byte from file vector
0008244E  2749 040E                290      MOVE.l  a1,V_INPTv(a3)      * set the input vector
00082452  6000 02A4                291      BRA     LAB_127D            * now we just wait for Basic command, no "Ready"
00082456                           292  
00082456                           293  LOAD_exit
00082456  6100 0516                294      BSR     LAB_147A            * go do "CLEAR"
0008245A  6000 028E                295      BRA     LAB_1274            * BASIC warm start entry, go wait for Basic
0008245E                           296                                  * command
