00083F2A                          5402  * this is the routine that does all the hard work for all the shape commands
00083F2A                          5403  * the parameters are interpreted depending on their number. if there are four
00083F2A                          5404  * parameters then they must be X1, Y1, X2 and Y2. if there are less or more
00083F2A                          5405  * than four then LINE_COLOUR and/or FILL_COLOUR must be present
