00083F4E  6700 002E               5428      BEQ     LAB_SRTS            * exit if no more parameters
00083F52                          5429  
00083F52                          5430  * if there are any parameters left then they must be X1, Y1, X2 and Y2
00083F52                          5431  * if there are less or more than four then something is wrong
00083F52                          5432  
00083F52  5941                    5433      SUBQ.w  #4,d1               * subtract 4 from parameter count
